  projectedS_admissible

/-! ## (B) THE COMPOSITION — `s = projectedS` composed into the D2c/D2d closed form. -/

/-- ★★★ THE COMPOSED ENDPOINT AT THE DERIVED `s` (the composition — s = 1/8 into D2c, welded through
    D2d): for `0 ≤ w < 1` and any join splitting `j` and band list,

        dressedInvAlphaEMJoin w projectedS j bands
