    (`dressedInvAlphaEM_closed`) with the free dial `s` REPLACED by the banked derived value
    `projectedS`. Once `(w, j, bands)` are fixed this is a DETERMINED point — no free `s` remains. -/
theorem composed_at_pinnedS_closed (w j : Cut) (hw0 : 0 ≤ w) (hw1 : w < 1)
